  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>We are announcing&nbsp;new peering locations for ExpressRoute:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Chicago2</li>\r\n\t<li>Pune</li>\r\n\t<li>Seoul2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Learn more about <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/expressroute/expressroute-introduction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ExpressRoute </a>and&nbsp;visit the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/expressroute/expressroute-locations-providers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ExpressRoute Locations and Partners</a>&nbsp;webpage for more information about peering locations and partnering service providers.&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "We are announcing new peering locations for ExpressRoute:\n\nChicago2\n\nPune\n\nSeoul2\n\nLearn more about ExpressRoute and visit the ExpressRoute Locations and Partners webpage for more information about peering locations and partnering service providers."
  },
